# Math Rendering in Chat

The chat UI does **not** render `$...$` or `$$...$$`. Always use:

- Inline math: `\(...\)` — e.g. `\(x^2 + y^2\)`
- Block/display math: `\[...\]` — e.g. `\[ \dot{x} = y \]`

❌ BAD — will show as raw text:
```
The eigenvalue $\lambda$ satisfies $\lambda^2 - \mu\lambda + 1 = 0$.
```

✅ GOOD — renders correctly:
```
The eigenvalue \(\lambda\) satisfies \(\lambda^2 - \mu\lambda + 1 = 0\).
```
